    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Generate a professional, concise, and ready-to-send email to the CEO using the invoice information provided below.\n\nInvoice Information:\n\nInvoice Number: {{ $json['Invoice Number'] }}\nSender Name: {{ $json['Sender Name'] }}\nSender Phone: {{ $json['Sender Phone'] }}\nSender Address: {{ $json['Sender Address'] }}\nTotal Amount: {{ $json['Total Amount'] }}\nInvoice Date: {{ $json['Invoice Date'] }}\nDue Date: {{ $json['Due Date'] }}\n\nRecipient:\nCEO Name: Khan\n\nEmail signature:\nBest regards,\nAli\nAutomation Expert\n12345\n\nInstructions:\n1. Generate a suitable professional subject for the email.\n2. Generate only the actual email body in the body field.\n3. The email must be completely ready to send.\n4. Address the CEO as \"Dear Khan,\".\n5. Clearly mention the important invoice information.\n6. Keep the email professional, natural, and easy to understand.\n7. Do not invent or add any invoice information that is not provided.\n8. Do not use markdown formatting.\n9. Do not use asterisks (*) anywhere.\n10. Do not use backslash characters (\\) anywhere in the email content.\n11. Do not include placeholders, variables, expressions, or template syntax in the generated email.\n12. Do not include explanations outside the email.\n13. End the email with:\nBest regards,\nAli\nAutomation Expert\n12345\n14. Return exactly two fields: subject and body.",
